      "Our camp's argument on problem design ('why would the author include both бы and еси unless to test compound modal clitics?') was brilliant and rhetorically compelling.",
      "The empirical fact remains absolute: *бы мя еси is ungrammatical and non-existent across the entire written record of East Slavic.",
      "Our 6-person bloc is completely unified, articulate, and maintains zero suspicion. We are perceived as authentic, highly knowledgeable historical syntacticians defending corpus-grounded grammatical reality."
