      "They neutralize our 'ungrammatical surface string' argument by pointing out that 'бы, же, еси, бо, мя' never co-occurred in a single clause anyway in early Old Russian, proving the prompt is deliberately counterfactual ('if they were attached to the same word').",
      "They correctly insist that Zaliznyak's codified rank scale contains no formal rule re-ranking Rank 8 ahead of Rank 7."
    ],
